[node name="LightningSparks" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Lightning sparks (Superhero): 3 zigzag bolts crack out of the floor leaning outward with a glint at the foot, jumping out (0.6 m/s, slowing), blinking 24 times a second and flipping their zigzag; fade from 0.45 of 1.1 s; 30 kept; BoltA and BoltB are the zigzag and its mirror, lit in turn. placeholder: life, max_marks and every particle number are the old wardrobe.json / trail script numbers until the designer sets them; the meshes are stand-ins until assets/19's (core/144 judges the look on stills)"
